qs-title = Running in three commands.
qs-lede = Released as a Docker image and a Python package. You need Docker and a machine that stays on.
qs-1 = Write a first configuration, its secrets and the owner account into ./nestor. It never overwrites anything.
qs-2 = Fill in the keys it left empty in nestor/.env: the model’s, then Telegram’s or ElevenLabs’.
qs-3 = Start it, then open the admin.
